    "detailed_description": "<strong>How to Play</strong><br>This is a choice-based visual novel game where you progress by clicking to read the text and making choices.<br><br><strong>Game Features</strong><br>Genre: Mystery x Sci-Fi<br>Choices: Multiple endings based on your choices<br>Playtime: Approximately 10 hours<br>Voice: No plans for voice acting<br><br><strong>Story</strong><br>In recent years, genetic research has led to the creation of beastmen.<br>This is a world where humans and beastmen coexist.<br>&quot;Naoshi Umemura,&quot; a university student, takes on a part-time job at a remote hotel run by relatives.<br>And, it's a hotel exclusively for beastmen...?<br>An event unfolds on a night when everyone is asleep...<br>Whether you can safely return from the hotel depends on your choices.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>How to Play</strong><br>This is a choice-based visual novel game where you progress by clicking to read the text and making choices.<br><br><strong>Game Features</strong><br>Genre: Mystery x Sci-Fi<br>Choices: Multiple endings based on your choices<br>Playtime: Approximately 10 hours<br>Voice: No plans for voice acting<br><br><strong>Story</strong><br>In recent years, genetic research has led to the creation of beastmen.<br>This is a world where humans and beastmen coexist.<br>&quot;Naoshi Umemura,&quot; a university student, takes on a part-time job at a remote hotel run by relatives.<br>And, it's a hotel exclusively for beastmen...?<br>An event unfolds on a night when everyone is asleep...<br>Whether you can safely return from the hotel depends on your choices.",
